# Reuse the preceding scenario's scratch settings and theme library.
log Reopen saved Woodshed appearance
settle 3
assert snap appearance-device-free == true
assert snap appearance-authoring == true
assert snap set-cards == 0
assert snap working-set-id == 1
assert snap song-bars == 0
assert snap song-playing == false
assert snap appearance-workshop == false
assert snap appearance-mode == hc_light
click .pill Settings
click .side-item Appearance
assert text WoodshedAcceptance
capture appearance_reopened
log Saved appearance reopen complete
